{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q131612101","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania</span></span>"},"pageid":78624959,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Seal_of_Pennsylvania.svg/330px-Seal_of_Pennsylvania.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":330},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7d/Seal_of_Pennsylvania.svg/330px-Seal_of_Pennsylvania.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":289,"height":289},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1382852398","tid":"c621b5ee-d486-11f1-8d6b-b95d9f19b19c","timestamp":"2026-10-30T17:24:34Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Pennsylvania"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 17 U.S. representatives from the State of Pennsylvania, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. Primary elections took place on May 19, 2026.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Pennsylvania</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the 17 U.S. representatives from the State of Pennsylvania, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. Primary elections took place on May 19, 2026.</p>"}